  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this project UNICEF provides PFA and MHPSS services to 16,500 affected children and caregivers through its Protection-CP activities (including CFS, mobile teams and structured parenting programmes) and WASH services to 315,000 affected people, through water trucking, quick repair of waterworks damaged by the earthquake, and distribution of hygiene kits, baby diapers and sanitary napkins to the displaced populations.</narrative>
